    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 29-layer planar multilayer thin film stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: air | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) | hfo2 | SiO2 (Gao)_substrate. Initialize all hfo2 layers at 32.6 nm thickness and all MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) layers at 48.0 nm thickness (quarter-wave optical thickness at 267 nm center wavelength). Optimize individual layer thicknesses with bounds of ±2.0 nm from initialization values. Wavelength bands: maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm, minimize transmittance in 300-700 nm, minimize transmittance in 700-1100 nm. Total layers: 29 film layers plus substrate. No metal layers. Use gradient_thickness optimizer. Evaluate candidates using coherent transfer matrix method. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all candidates.",
